{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/12/4190696/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は紅白SP拡大版\n見てくれた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はわたものだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/12/4190696/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先々週に引き続き\nまた6人で出演させていただきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の星っぽいメンバーね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も2つのドラマをやらせてもらったんだけど\n全然違う役だよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタイン直前という事で\nバレンタインに因んだお話だよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/12/4190696/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/12/4190696/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK-FM\n『私たちの物語』\n午後10時～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、\nバレンタイン直前！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の飯ぺろは\nバレンタイン義理チョコ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は乃木坂入ってから\nだいたいメンバーには手作り\nスタッフさんには買いチョコって感じですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂入ってから\n既に4回バレンタインを経験してるので\n今までのバレンタインでスタッフさんに渡した\n買いチョコを\n覚えてる限り紹介しようと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/